Set the reporting format to <i>normal</i> (default), <i>column</i>, or <i>json</i>. Only one output format can be used at a time.</dd></dl>"],["EXAMPLES",4],["NVME",5]],"diff":{"r":["--verbose","-v"],"u":[]}}